@startuml collaboration-diagram
' Collaboration(Communication) Diagram - calculatorReceiption
' 카드 영수증 PDF → 지출비상세정산서(Excel) + 영수증 합본(PDF) 생성 흐름

skinparam defaultFontName "Malgun Gothic"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam rectangle {
    BackgroundColor #FEFEFE
    BorderColor #444444
}
skinparam database {
    BackgroundColor #F5F5F5
    BorderColor #444444
}
skinparam arrow {
    Color #333333
    FontSize 11
}

actor "사용자" as User

rectangle ":Main\n(main.go)" as Main
rectangle ":ConfigLoader\n(loadConfig)" as Config
rectangle ":OverrideLoader\n(loadOverrides)" as Override
rectangle ":PDFParser\n(parsePDF / extractText)" as Parser
rectangle ":Categorizer\n(applyCategory)" as Category
rectangle ":ExcelGenerator\n(generateExcel)" as Excel
rectangle ":ImageConverter\n(imageToPDF)" as ImgConv
rectangle ":PDFMerger\n(mergePDFs)" as Merger

database "config.json" as ConfigFile
database "input/{월}/\noverrides.json" as OverrideFile
database "input/{월}/\n*.pdf, *_2.jpg" as InputDir
database "metaData/\n*샘플*.xlsx (템플릿)" as Template
database "output/{월}/\n정산서.xlsx, 합본.pdf" as OutputDir

' ── 메시지 흐름 (번호 순서대로) ──
User -right-> Main : 1: calculator input/{월}

Main -down-> Config : 2: loadConfig()
Config -down-> ConfigFile : 2.1: read

Main -down-> Override : 3: loadOverrides(inputDir)
Override -down-> OverrideFile : 3.1: read

Main -up-> InputDir : 4: ReadDir()\n영수증 PDF 목록 수집
Main -up-> Template : 5: 템플릿 탐색

Main -right-> Parser : 6: parsePDF(path) *[각 PDF]
Parser -up-> InputDir : 6.1: extractText()\n(ledongthuc/pdf)
Parser --> Main : 6.2: Receipt{날짜, 금액, 가맹점}

Main -right-> Category : 7: applyCategory(receipt)\n[override 없을 때]
Category --> Main : 7.1: 계정No / 계정 / 목적

Main -down-> Excel : 8: generateExcel(receipts)
Excel -up-> Template : 8.1: OpenFile()\n(excelize)
Excel -down-> OutputDir : 8.2: SaveAs()\n지출비상세정산서_YY.MM.xlsx

Main -down-> ImgConv : 9: imageToPDF(*_2.jpg)\n[동반 이미지 존재 시]
ImgConv -down-> OutputDir : 9.1: A4 PDF 저장\n(pdfcpu)

Main -down-> Merger : 10: mergePDFs(날짜순 목록)
Merger -down-> OutputDir : 10.1: MergeCreateFile()\n{월}월 지출경비영수증.pdf

@enduml
